    {
      "kind": "geometry",
      "note": "Root radius/full=9999 produces the same fully rounded 40x22 track silhouette as common medium radius11. Thumb is an ELLIPSE; its radius property 0 does not mean a square. Keep outer thumb positions (2,2)/(20,2), travel18, even when adapting the CSS border model."
